  {
    "question_number": "SectionB_Q1(d)",
    "answer_text": "**顯示處理器的運算能力 (中央處理器)**。因為該編碼方案在表示上需要額外運算。",
    "source_page": 88,
    "answer_type": "explanation"
  },
  {
    "question_number": "1(a)",
    "answer_text": "**SELECT PNAME FROM PSTUD WHERE SID = 'S0013'**\n全對",
    "source_page": 89,
    "answer_type": "sql_answer"
  },
  {
    "question_number": "1(b)",
    "answer_text": "**SELECT COUNT(PID) FROM SCHOOL, PSTUD WHERE SCHOOL.SID = PSTUD.SID AND SNAME LIKE '%GOVERNMENT%'**\n或 COUNT(*)\n其他答案: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM PSTUD WHERE SID IN (SELECT SID FROM SCHOOL WHERE SNAME LIKE '%GOVERNMENT%')",
    "source_page": 89,
    "answer_type": "sql_answer"
  },
  {
    "question_number": "1(c)",
    "answer_text": "**SELECT PNAME FROM PSTUD P, MARK M WHERE P.PID = M.PID AND GP = 'J' AND SMARK >= 60**",
    "source_page": 89,
    "answer_type": "sql_answer"
  },
  {
    "question_number": "1(d)",
    "answer_text": "**找出在高級組沒有出戰比賽 (沒有分數) 的首次報名參賽學生。**\n(3 個中有 2 個)",
    "source_page": 89,
    "answer_type": "explanation"
  },
  {
    "question_number": "1(e)",
    "answer_text": "**SUM(MARK)**\n**S.SID = P.SID AND P.PID = M.PID**\n**S.SID**",
    "source_page": 89,
    "answer_type": "sql_completion_answer"
  },
  {
    "question_number": "1(f)",
    "answer_text": "**SELECT SNAME FROM TM, SCHOOL S WHERE TM.SID = S.SID AND TOTAL IN (SELECT MAX(TOTAL) FROM TM)**\n其他答案: SELECT SNAME FROM SCHOOL WHERE SID IN (SELECT SID FROM TM WHERE TOTAL IN (SELECT MAX(TOTAL) FROM TM))\n選擇的數據庫受讀取\n正確使用 IN\nSELECT 框句 (3 個中有 2 個)",
    "source_page": 89,
    "answer_type": "sql_answer"
  },
  {
    "question_number": "2(a)",
    "answer_text": "**ITEMNO + DOB**\n**ITEMNO + DOR**",
